OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(W)
OL,3,GNEWSAHow Windrush children helped shape
OL,4,AWolverhampton
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Today's diverse city did not simply
OL,7,Fappear. It has been shaped over decades
OL,8,Fby successive generations of people
OL,9,Fmaking Wolverhampton their home and
OL,10,Fcontributing to its economic, social
OL,11,Fand cultural life," he said.
